# Only needed when the data or the models are NOT in the default places.
# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and remove the # in front of the lines you need.
# Settings made in Windows (System > Environment variables) win over this file.
#
# Default layout (nothing to set):
#   <CG2>\GC2-Ensemble-Model-Pottery  <- this project (any folder name)
#   <CG2>\new image data              <- the data (DOWNLOAD_DATA_ORIGINAL_AND_SEGMENTATION.bat)
#   <CG2>\model_cache                 <- the models (SETUP.bat)
#
# CG2_ROOT=E:\CG2
# CG2_DATA=E:\ceramic data\new image data
# CG2_MODEL_CACHE=E:\ceramic data\model_cache
